      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "一个星期五的晚上，下着雨，路上的人很少。",
      "traditional": "一個星期五的晚上，下著雨，路上的人很少。",
      "pinyin": "yí ge xīng qī wǔ de wǎn shang xià zhe yǔ lù shang de rén hěn shǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽一个人走在路上，有个人跑出来，要丽丽给钱。",
      "traditional": "麗麗一個人走在路上，有個人跑出來，要麗麗給錢。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yí ge rén zǒu zài lù shang yǒu ge rén pǎo chū lái yào lì lì gěi qián",
      "english": "A Friday evening, it was raining, and very few people were out in the street."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "丽丽没有给他钱，他杀了丽丽。",
      "traditional": "麗麗沒有給他錢，他殺了麗麗。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì méi yǒu gěi tā qián tā shā le lì lì",
      "english": "Lili was on her way by herself. Someone came running and wanted Lili to give them money."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili didn’t give him money, and so he killed Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "丽丽被杀了！我跳了起来！我这才发现，这是一个梦。",
      "traditional": "麗麗被殺了！我跳了起來！我這才發現，這是一個夢。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bèi shā le wǒ tiào le qǐ lái wǒ zhè cái fā xiàn zhè shì yí ge mèng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili was killed! I jumped up! Not until now did I realize that this was a dream."
    }
  ],
